      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{d}{dx}(\\sin^5x)&=5\\sin^4x\\cos x\\\\\\sin^4x\\cos x&=\\frac15\\times5\\sin^4x\\cos x\\\\\\int\\sin^4x\\cos x\\,dx&=\\frac15\\sin^5x+C\\end{align*}$$",
